# OffensIA authorized scope — DEFAULT DENY.
#
# One entry per line. Nothing is tested unless it appears here, and only with
# written authorization from the target owner (contract, ticket, bug-bounty
# program) or your own lab.
#
# Forms supported:
#   example.com                exact host
#   *.example.com              domain + subdomains
#   10.0.0.0/24                CIDR
#   192.168.1.10               IP
#   !secret.example.com        exclusion (wins over any allow)
#
# Metadata goes in the trailing comment, e.g.:
#   app.authorized.example     # auth=CONTRACT-2026-001 engagement=ENG-42
#
# Examples (commented out — uncomment and edit):
# 127.0.0.1                    # LAB
# *.lab.internal               # auth=LAB
